{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I really think you do attract strange men, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Maybe so...": "",
  "You really said you were gonna marry him as a kid?": "",
  "Yeah. I completely forgot about that.": "",
  "Proposals you make as a child don't actually count, do they?": "",
  "No, I don't think so. But he seems to have taken it seriously enough.": "",
  "Well, Yagami-san. Despite all the crazy things that happened today, I had a lot of fun hanging out with you.": "",
  "Our interview practice was really helpful, too!": "",
  "Again, thank you so much.": "",
  "Phew... That interview really kicked my butt. I'm exhausted!": "",
  "You really did rack your brain there. Not to mention having to deal with that \"English gentleman\" of yours.": "",
  "Right... Sorry you had to go through that with me.": "",
  "(I wonder if she had a good time today...)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san! Sorry to keep you waiting.": "",
  "I see you're dressing casual today.": "",
  "Yeah. I wanted to take a break from all the office stuff.": "",
  "Hm? What's wrong?": "",
  "Have you noticed anything... different about me?": "",
  "Oh, that would be...": "",
  "(<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Is</font_kind> something different about her?)": "",
  "(Hmm... Did she have those earrings on before?)": "",
  "Aha, it's those earrings. They're really nice.": "",
  "So you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> notice! About time.": "",
  "Of course. They caught my eye right away.": "",
  "Aren't they gorgeous?": "",
  "(Whew. Lucky guess.)": "",
  "(Didn't she wear these before? ...I honestly have no idea.)": "",
  "(...Her bust size hasn't changed overnight, has it? Maybe from C to B?)": "",
  "Hey. My eyes are up here, you know.": "",
  "Oh, I wasn't... Uh... Yeah...": "",
  "...Jerk.": "",
  "(Are her clothes new?)": "",
  "Are those new clothes you're wearing?": "",
  "Huh? I'm pretty sure I wore these in front of you before.": "",
  "Huh? Really? In that case...": "",
  "(Nah, I've seen her wear those.)": "",
  "(Did she cut her hair?)": "",
  "Oh, I get it. You got a haircut, didn't you?": "",
  "Huh? No I didn't.": "",
  "Really? I see. Then...": "",
  "(No, her hair pretty much looks the same.)": "",
  "Do you wanna go hang out somewhere?": "",
  "We could go to the casino, play darts, or...": "",
  "I think the casino will suit us just fine.": "",
  "R-Ryuzenji-san!?": "",
  "Ah, my sweet Tsukino-san. What a lovely coincidence.": "",
  "Nay—it was destiny that led me here! True soulmates can sense each other's presence, you know.": "",
  "I... wouldn't know...": "",
  "Hey, you didn't follow us here, did you?": "",
  "Preposterous! A true English gentleman would never resort to such underhanded tactics!": "",
  "Now listen up, peasant. You and I shall engage in the ultimate test of stamina, fortitude, and masculinity: poker!": "",
  "Thus, we will prove to Tsukino-san which of us is the superior man!": "",
  "Let's just say you're the superior man. Will that make you go away?": "",
  "Oh? So you'd simply abandon our duel? And in front of the lady, too...": "",
  "I hardly think that pressuring me into a card game qualifies as a duel.": "",
  "Hmph. I take it you're admitting defeat? Very well! Then Tsukino-san goes with me!": "",
  "(This guy... If I don't do something, he might actually take her away.)": "",
  "Fine. I accept your stupid challenge.": "",
  "Yagami-san, are you sure?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm sure. I'll make him cry like the spoiled brat he is.": "",
  "Ahahaha. Say what you will, but a true English gentleman never loses his composure, whether in victory or defeat!": "",
  "However, can the same be said for such a lowly peasant as you?": "",
  "My advice? Keep your handkerchief handy... That way you can bawl your eyes out once I give you a sound thrashing! Ahaha!": "",
  "(He just says whatever the hell he wants, doesn't he...)": "",
  "Yukikawa! We're taking them to the casino with us.": "",
  "*ahem* This will be decided with a single match.": "",
  "Fine by me.": "",
  "Prepare to be awed and amazed, Tsukino-san.": "",
  "For I will dash this peasant man's dreams to pieces and show you how capable I truly am!": "",
  "R-Right...": "",
  "Victory is mine!": "",
  "Wow, Yagami-san! You did it!": "",
  "Ggh! How...? How can this possibly be? Losing to a miscreant like you...": "",
  "Heh, you should see the look on your face. I don't have a handkerchief, but I know I can find you some pocket tissues.": "",
  "How... How dare you...!": "",
  "Ahahahaha! You see that, Tsukino-san!? You see how I completely made an ass out of him?": "",
  "W-Well... it is pretty impressive you can beat Yagami-san out of all people...": "",
  "Ah, what's this I hear? A whisper of sweet praise from the honeyed lips of my betrothed? Oh, the feeling is divine!": "",
  "Well, you did manage to win. I guess that's an accomplishment.": "",
  "What on earth is the matter with you? Shouldn't you be wallowing in self-pity after losing in front of Tsukino-san?": "",
  "Well, I am a little annoyed. But in the end it's just a game.": "",
  "...Hah. A pitiful excuse from a man who's lost his mettle! You cannot hide your shame from me.": "",
  "In any case. Tsukino-san, if I could have your attention, please...": "",
  "*ahem* If you are the Moon, then I am the Earth: two celestial bodies spun together by the gravity of fate...": "",
  "Now, let us swear an oath to join ourselves as one... until the universe sighs its final dying light and fades away.": "",
  "...What are you talking about?": "",
  "Tsukino-chan. Will you consent to our betrothal?": "",
  "I've already booked the wedding hall. Now let us be on our merry way.": "",
  "W-Wait a minute! Ryuzenji-san!": "",
  "...I can't. I already have plans today... I'm sorry.": "",
  "Oh... Is this true?": "",
  "Yes. I promised Yagami-san we'd do something.": "",
  "I... I see. Well. I suppose it would be unlike you to break a promise.": "",
  "I will respect the wishes of my fiancée... ": "",
  "I'd appreciate that.": "",
  "Oh, but before I take my leave...": "",
  "You. Peasant. You had better not be toying with Tsukino-san's heart, you hear me?": "",
  "I won't let you lay a finger on my fiancée. And don't you forget it! ": "",
  "Let us depart, Yukikawa!": "",
  "Ugh... Sorry you had to go through that again.": "",
  "Ready to get going?": "",
  "Sorry to hear your interview was a bust.": "",
  "...To be honest, I kind of already knew it.": "",
  "I realized while I was at the interview that something just didn't click.": "",
  "How so?": "",
  "Maybe you were thinking deep down that the job just wasn't for you?": "",
  "Yeah, I think you're right.": "",
  "How perceptive you are.": "",
  "Either way, I'm sure you'll do better next time.": "",
  "Really? 'Cause I'm starting to feel like I'll be rejected anywhere I go.": "",
  "Well, if the interviewers catch you thinking like that, that's exactly what'll happen.": "",
  "But... how can I keep moving forward... when I'm totally empty inside?": "",
  "...I think that no one's hired me because they can see right through me.": "",
  "And honestly, I'm not even sure I want to go into publishing.": "",
  "I thought you were all about that stuff.": "",
  "I only started applying for those types of jobs so I wouldn't be tied down to my family.": "",
  "Mm. Understood.": "",
  "No wonder I keep getting rejected...": "",
  "That Ryuzenji really seems to have a thing for you, though. He wants this marriage <font_kind=yakuza_italic>bad</font_kind>.": "",
  "So it seems...": "",
  "It's all because of what I blurted out as a kid.": "",
  "That marriage promise, huh?": "",
  "...Yeah. I can't exactly turn him down, either.": "",
  "Why? Is it because his parents know yours?": "",
  "Exactly. Basically, my parents' company is a subsidiary of his parents' company. It's called the Ryuzenji Group.": "",
  "So you want to avoid causing trouble for your parents? That I can understand.": "",
  "You know, people will take advantage of you if you don't speak up for yourself. You should make your feelings heard.": "",
  "Well, I'm aware of that, but...": "",
  "You still can't bring yourself to do it?": "",
  "Right. Ever since I was little, my parents would always tell me not to upset the Ryuzenji family...": "",
  "My dad said if they cut ties with us, their company would go bankrupt.": "",
  "They can't cut ties with you... if you don't wear a tie in the first place.": "",
  "Sorry. Couldn't help it.": "",
  "O... Okay...": "",
  "(Damn. That sounded a lot funnier in my head.)": "",
  "So you can't just brush him off, huh... That's tough.": "",
  "I'm glad you understand... At least I have one person on my side.": "",
  "So. How about showing me those drawings sometime?": "",
  "But... I'm still a little embarrassed...": "",
  "I know. And I'm still interested.": "",
  "Well... I'll give it some thought.": "",
  "Tsukino-chan. By any chance, have you ever made your art public before?": "",
  "Actually... I sometimes post them up online. Under an alias, of course.": "",
  "Does Yosuke know?": "",
  "No. I haven't told him anything.": "",
  "...You really want to see my drawings that badly, huh?": "",
  "But you'd better not laugh, okay? I've never shown these to anyone in person.": "",
  "I consider myself honored.": "",
  "Actually... I saved all my pictures to my phone. Here.": "",
  "...So what do you think?": "",
  "Come on! At least say <font_kind=yakuza_italic>something</font_kind>!": "",
  "Oh. Sorry. I was just in awe... because they were so good.": "",
  "Whoa! These are incredible!": "",
  "You... really think so?": "",
  "Yeah, they're amazing. I had no idea you were this good... You're pretty much a professional already.": "",
  "I mean, people would pay good money for these.": "",
  "Hehe. Why thank you.": "",
  "Actually, I've been studying how to draw for most of my life. I even went to art classes and everything.": "",
  "Wow, you sure put in work...": "",
  "What is it about drawing that you like in particular?": "",
  "For one, it makes me happy when other people comment on my drawings. Even if it is anonymously.": "",
  "Also...": "",
  "I think that being creative and inspiring other people are the two best things in the world!": "",
  "Ah. I see.": "",
  "Someday, I think I'd like to interface with people directly about my work.": "",
  "Well, if you ever decide to go pro, you could show your art to everyone and even turn a nice profit.": "",
  "Y-Yeah, but...": "",
  "I think you should make this your career. I mean, you have the passion. You definitely have the talent. So why not go all in?": "",
  "...You really think I should?": "",
  "I do. Now I'm no artist, but I know talent when I see it.": "",
  "Thanks... You know, I will say the thought of going professional has crossed my mind...": "",
  "But I hear it's pretty hard to actually make a living as an artist.": "",
  "Besides, my parents would just shoot it down anyway.": "",
  "Would you do it if you could, though?": "",
  "Well... yes, but it's not as simple as that. There are a lot of factors at stake here.": "",
  "I think I can empathize.": "",
  "In fact, I went through the same sort of thing back when I started my career.": "",
  "Well, no one can know for sure.": "",
  "But what I'm getting at is... I used to question myself, too. About whether I could reach my goal or not.": "",
  "Yeah. I actually used to be a lawyer...": "",
  "What...? You, a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>lawyer</font_kind>?": "",
  "I was until three years ago. I never even went to college. I just studied on my own and ended up getting a license.": "",
  "That's... incredible...": "",
  "But since I didn't really go the academic route, I wasn't really sure if I could hang with the big boys.": "",
  "After all, I had to use whatever resources I could find to scrape my knowledge together.": "",
  "And how did that turn out?": "",
  "It was tough at first, but it all worked out in the end. After all, there's no greater teacher than experience.": "",
  "After getting thrown into an office and working my ass off nonstop, I woke up one day and realized I was actually good at my job.": "",
  "Hmm... So all you needed was some hands-on experience...": "",
  "Right. It was the same when I became a detective, too.": "",
  "Somehow things just worked out. Probably because I dove right in without thinking too much.": "",
  "You just sorta went for it, huh?": "",
  "Yeah. But what works for me might not work for everyone else, so...": "",
  "Thanks for hanging out with me today. I really needed this.": "",
  "No problem. I'm sure it's not easy having to look through so many jobs, but it'll pay off in the long run. I know it will.": "",
  "Has anyone ever told you how amazing you are?": "",
  "Huh? Where's all this coming from?": "",
  "Well, I was just thinking about how I've been going about things... and I realized how timid I am. About everything.": "",
  "You, on the other hand, seem like the type who isn't satisfied unless they're doing exactly what they want.": "",
  "...Yeah, that does sound like me.": "",
  "And I admire that... a lot!": "",
  "Hahaha. I appreciate you saying that.": "",
  "So. I've decided to take a deeper look at how I really want to live my life.": "",
  "That's good. And remember, you can always count on me for support.": "",
  "Thank you, Yagami-san. For making our conversations really meaningful.": "",
  "Not to mention a lot of fun!": "",
  "Any time. Hope I helped clear your head a little.": "",
  "Definitely! ...Text me sometime, okay?": "",
  "Phew. I'm a little exhausted from letting all that out...": "",
  "Thanks for today, Yagami-san. See you later.": "",
  "Hey, sorry to keep you waiting.": "",
  "No worries. Congrats on making it past the resume screening.": "",
  "Thanks! I can hardly believe it myself.": "",
  "You seem a little different today.": "",
  "Oh yeah, I actually have an interview after this. They told me to come dressed casually.": "",
  "Oh! Then... are you gonna be okay on time?": "",
  "Yeah, we've got some time till the interview. Besides... I'd feel a lot more relaxed just talking with you until then.": "",
  "Gotcha. Is there anything in particular you wanted to do?": "",
  "We could play darts, go to the arcade...": "",
  "Ooh, let's play darts... I saw that on TV yesterday.": "",
  "Darts it is, then.": "",
  "Ugh. You again...": "",
  "Tell me. Have you ever stopped to contemplate the beauty of the Moon as it shines in the night sky?": "",
  "I've been dwelling upon the rotation of the heavens for quite some time. And I had the most curious epiphany...": "",
  "The Moon is only beautiful because you look up at it from Earth.": "",
  "Like a duplicitous lover, it draws tantalizingly close, almost within reach... but you can never truly touch it.": "",
  "Thus, the Earth is necessary for the Moon to boast merit in beauty.": "",
  "And the Earth that inches closer to the Moon, slowly but surely... is me!": "",
  "...Do you ever actually make sense? Or do you only speak gibberish around me?": "",
  "Enough playing the fool. You and I will decide our worth as gentlemen with the honorable pastime of darts.": "",
  "Um. We're in the middle of a date here...": "",
  "Rubbish. If you fancy a date with my fiancée, then defeat me at the dartboard.": "",
  "Then perhaps I may lend her to you. For the better part of an hour or so.": "",
  "...Sorry, but I don't need your permission.": "",
  "And Tsukino-chan isn't some trophy that you can lend at will.": "",
  "That much is obvious. But it is my duty as an English gentleman to escort her safely wherever she pleases!": "",
  "And that is why I refuse to allow such an unscrupulous lowborn street rat to fall into Tsukino-san's good graces!": "",
  "Now have at thee!": "",
  "...Let's get out of here, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Oh, okay.": "",
  "Hey! You cannot simply <font_kind=yakuza_italic>ignore</font_kind> me, you sniveling swine!": "",
  "...Damn. I almost hoped you'd disappear if I looked the other way.": "",
  "If you find fault with my perseverance, then defeat me at the dartboard! Or do you wish to dishonor Tsukino-chan?": "",
  "(I get the feeling he won't shut up unless I actually go through with this.)": "",
  "Ahh, that's more like it.": "",
  "Sorry, Yagami-san... This happens every time...": "",
  "Now then. The stadium awaits.": "",
  "Let us be off, Yukikawa.": "",
  "How... How is this even possible?": "",
  "All right then. I'll be off with Tsukino-chan, now.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Maybe so...": "อาจจะงั้น...",
  "Hm? What's wrong?": "หืม? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "...Jerk.": "...ไอ้เวร",
  "Fine by me.": "ไม่มีปัญหา",
  "R-Right...": "ถ-ถูกต้อง...",
  "...What are you talking about?": "...พูดเรื่องอะไรกันเนี่ย?",
  "How so?": "ต่างกันยังไง?",
  "Yeah, I think you're right.": "ค่ะ ฉันก็คิดว่าคุณพูดถูก",
